# Local development tooling

## Run the site locally

Canonical (static pages **and** `proxy.php`):

```bash
php -S 127.0.0.1:8000
# open http://127.0.0.1:8000/scales.html
```

- `python3 -m http.server 8000` — static only. Fine for practice pages; not
  for Music search or Books URL import.
- `npm run dev` — Node static server on **8765** plus frontend error sink
  (used by `dev-error-monitor.js`). No PHP proxy.
- `python3 dev-server.py` — alternate static server on 8000 with livereload.
  Optional; not the documented default.

Fresh cloud VM: `./setup-cloud-agent.sh` once (php, npm deps, Playwright).

## Verify before ship

```bash
npm test && npm run lint && npm run typecheck   # npm test = whole gate, ~13s
# while iterating on one product: node tests/run-all.js --suite <file>
# when touching proxy.php: php -l proxy.php
```

Ship / bump / master push: `.cursor/rules/10-deploy-workflow.mdc`.
